  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-数据报表\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"该接口可用于获取千川全域投放抖音号维度的数据，可根据营销目标、时间范围、数据维度等条件进行筛选和排序。需配合【获取Access token】接口使用获取授权。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.report.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/uni_promotion/dimension_data/author/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1786236031165513\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"open_api.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1786236031165513\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"获取全域投放抖音号维度数据\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\">\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201785607939823627%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-THgrUV7V\" id=\"h346b9f0-THgrUV7V\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-9jGEku1J\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/uni_promotion/dimension_data/author/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/uni_promotion/dimension_data/author/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1786236031165513\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-dbanKTdl\" id=\"h346b9f0-dbanKTdl\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-1GHWxo1S\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-QmVnAv02\" id=\"h346b9f0-QmVnAv02\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j2BFhiGF\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z1Kymhqy\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-mJZAg7tr\" id=\"h346b9f0-mJZAg7tr\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YmA7xTz6\">千川投放账户id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 营销目标，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0JAh0JTk\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AQid0eIX\"><code>ALL</code> 全部（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-k2HXMl8Q\"><code>LIVE_PROM_GOODS</code> 直播全域</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PjG5VMVI\"><code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code> 商品全域</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PVPhrN8J\">抖音号id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">metrics</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-x14psLdX\">需要查询的消耗指标，见返回参数，默认返回stat_cost</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-e6Exb1jz\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">开始时间，格式 </span><code>2021-04-05 00:00:00</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">，开始时间不得早于</span><code>今日-180</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">天</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9nt4Jq1x\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">结束时间，格式 </span><code>2021-04-05 23:59:59</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">，\n若传dimension为</span><code>TIME_GRANULARITY_HOURLY</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 小时纬度，则时间跨度不能超过</span><code>7</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">天，其余情况时间跨度不能超过</span><code>180</code><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">天</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">dimension</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7ObEEM8R\">数据维度 ，如果不传，返回查询日期内的汇总数据\n</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-464luwqM\">允许值:\n</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-Me28r2s9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FUbHEL6K\"><code>TIME_GRANULARITY_DAILY</code> (按天维度),会返回每天的数据\n</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JYxVjRyK\"><code>TIME_GRANULARITY_HOURLY</code> (按小时维度)，会返回每小时维度的数据</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ljQv6TZW\">排序方式，允许值：\n</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-VJPZC3LH\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jGnySoGh\"><code>ASC</code> 升序（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-O0OzWaGB\"><code>DESC</code> 降序</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CZPNGA1m\"> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">排序字段，允许值参考数据指标，见返回字段，默认不传为</span><code>stat_cost</code>，排序字段需在metrics中</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">过滤器</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_platform</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">下单平台，可选值:<ul data-id=\"u738a58b-7MQfBIdf\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dAYlrGX7\"><code>ALL</code>：全部  </li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5LMvQD4Y\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code>： 千川pc（默认）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2Y8N2uYt\"><code>ECP_AWEME</code>：小店随心推</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">smart_bid_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">投放方式 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-bgPZqnn5\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hwosE4P3\"><code>SMART_BID_CONSERVATIVE</code> 放量投放</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OO7EZucQ\"><code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code> 控成本投放</li></ul> 默认值: <code>SMART_BID_CUSTOM</code></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MPYyStzD\">页码，  默认值: <code>1</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">page_size</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X8fJBaHl\">页面大小，  默认值: <code>10</code></p></section></section></section><p data-id=\"p838747a-pn5gQU1P\"><br/></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-7X6fAALV\" id=\"h346b9f0-7X6fAALV\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Freport%2Funi_promotion%2Fdimension_data%2Fauthor%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5C